ablations/vendor/deepseek-harness/packages/llm/llm-deepseek-api-key/README.md:40:`models` is an independently configurable catalog for this provider; defaults and protocol capabilities come from the shared transport. While `models` equals the built-in catalog and the Messages origin is the official API, `https://api.deepseek.com`, the route serves the official `GET https://api.deepseek.com/models` listing instead. Listing requests carry the API key in `x-api-key` and the harness `User-Agent`, and reject redirects; without an API key the route requests nothing. Any other endpoint, including one named by `baseURL` or `$DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL`, serves `models` and requests no listing. Discovery does not probe inference endpoints.
